## Inputs

- `water_dimer_d3bj_kpoint_forces.inp` — D3(BJ) + MP 1×1×2 + ENERGY_FORCE
- `water_dimer_plain_kpoint_forces.inp` — identical without `&VDW_POTENTIAL`

